{\pard\sb280\sa100\b\fs24\cf2 PART 3: PRIVACY & TELEMETRY SUMMARY\cf1\par}
{\pard\fi-300\li300\sb80\sa60\sl276\slmult1 1. {\b WHAT IS COLLECTED:} \par}
{\pard\fi-180\li560\sa30\sl276\slmult1 \bullet  Device hardware specifications: Hostname, OS edition, CPU model, RAM MT/s, drive capacities, battery status, and NVIDIA GPU statistics.\par}
{\pard\fi-180\li560\sa30\sl276\slmult1 \bullet  Performance metrics: Real-time CPU%, RAM%, temperatures, and fan speeds.\par}
{\pard\fi-180\li560\sa30\sl276\slmult1 \bullet  Activity data (default on, can be turned off with share_activity = false): Names of the top 5 processes by memory usage (e.g. chrome.exe) and system boot, sleep, and wake timestamps.\par}
{\pard\fi-300\li300\sb80\sa60\sl276\slmult1 2. {\b ZERO SURVEILLANCE GUARANTEE:} Nexus strictly NEVER collects, records, or accesses:\par}
