{\pard\fi-180\li560\sa30\sl276\slmult1 \bullet  File contents, personal documents, or directories\par}
{\pard\fi-180\li560\sa30\sl276\slmult1 \bullet  Browser history, URLs, or network packets\par}
{\pard\fi-180\li560\sa30\sl276\slmult1 \bullet  Microphones, cameras, or GPS location\par}
{\pard\fi-300\li300\sb80\sa60\sl276\slmult1 3. {\b DATA RETENTION:} Minute-level telemetry rollups are stored for 7 days in the Convex database and automatically purged thereafter. Account records are kept until you initiate account deletion.\par}
{\pard\fi-300\li300\sb80\sa60\sl276\slmult1 4. {\b YOUR RIGHTS:} You have full access to self-service JSON data export (Right to Data Portability) and permanent cascading account deletion (Right to Erasure) directly from the Nexus dashboard at any time.\par}
